                                                "sense_id": "97eca4da-7aa1-3271-819d-183816f1f4ba",
                                                "text": "It breaks loose one rope at a time, haphazardly, tossing the Filipinos up into the air. A boy with a machete cuts the one remaining line, which pops up and lashes him across the face."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
